Z||000000||batboy||02-16-2000||10:52 PM||||While visiting my Uncle in Ohio, he took me over to his neighbor's place to have a gander at some of his old cars. This guy has a whole bunch of Model A Fords, old trucks and Mustang convertibles. He showed us two big sheds full of cars, it looked like a museum. I get crap all the time about having 7 or 8 more cars than I need, but this guy has 45 vehicles. Lots of car show trophys too. The West Virginia Hillbilly's truck is driven in lots of parades. Second pic is a line of Model A's and the red 54 Ford is totally customized. Gotta love 'em! He does all his own work.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://sites.netscape.net/gardengoddessl/WVhillbilly.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://sites.netscape.net/gardengoddessl/modelA.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://sites.netscape.net/gardengoddessl/54Ford.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by batboy (edited 02-17-2000).]||||reg||1
