Z||000004||batboy||02-17-2000||08:01 AM||||My Uncle's neighbor is amazing. In the middle pic, he made the motorcycle side-car from a kid's soap-box derby car. There is stuff like that everywhere in his sheds. He has a fortune in old parts just hanging from all the walls.||||reg||1
Z||000005||william_thorniii||02-17-2000||09:18 AM||||Bat,<P>That bottom picture of the '56 Fairlane Club Sedan I really like.  I own the same car.  Mine has not been customized quite so much but it somewhere between there and stock.  Would this guy allow tours.  There are lots of Fiero Folk here in OH and we are always talking about heading over to Hocking Co. fr a cruise.  I can't imagine that is too far away.  I would really love to see his collection.  <P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
