Z||000008||batboy||02-17-2000||07:13 PM||||There is a Whizzer bike in that pic, he showed me a picture of what it looked like when he bought it. A crate of old rusted parts that he paid $700 for, he said his wife about skinned him alive. He's bought lots of Model A's for less than that. He figures it's worth several thousand now that he has restored it.<P>I hate to impose on this guy, I don't really know him. It's one thing for his next door neighbor to call up and ask to bring his nephew over to look at his cars. It's quite another for a stranger to ask if a bunch of other strangers that he knows from the internet can come over and look at his cars.||||reg||1
Z||000009||william_thorniii||02-17-2000||08:51 PM||||Bat,<P>Good point!  I just figured that like most car guys he enjoyed showing his toys off.  Not a problem.<P>William T. Thorn, III||||reg||10
